msgid ""
msgstr "Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "Output new message(s) to GL-E750 display"
msgstr "Tampilkan pesan baru di layar GL-E750"

msgid "Display is limited to Latin alphabet only. Translit will be used for Cyrillic symbols. E.g. Bud'te schastlivy!"
msgstr "Layar hanya mendukung huruf Latin. Karakter Sirilik akan ditransliterasi. Contoh: Bud'te schastlivy!"

msgid "Show only the last message"
msgstr "Tampilkan hanya pesan terakhir"

msgid "When off all unread SMS will be displayed cycling in the order of time received starting with the most recent."
msgstr "Jika nonaktif, semua SMS belum dibaca ditampilkan bergiliran sesuai urutan waktu diterima, dimulai dari yang terbaru."

msgid "Time to display messages, seconds"
msgstr "Waktu tampilan pesan, detik"

msgid "Timer restarts on input. Configure actions in 'Buttons'."
msgstr "Timer dimulai ulang saat ada input. Atur aksi di \"Tombol\"."

msgid "Flash GL-E750 display"
msgstr "Kedipkan layar GL-E750"

msgid "AmneziaWG full tunnel"
msgstr "AmneziaWG: tunnel penuh"

msgid "Sets AmneziaWG to full tunnel: configured interface started if down, all remote traffic routed via AmneziaWG."
msgstr "Mengatur AmneziaWG ke tunnel penuh: antarmuka yang dikonfigurasi dijalankan jika mati, semua lalu lintas ke luar dirutekan melalui AmneziaWG."

msgid "AmneziaWG split tunnel"
msgstr "AmneziaWG: tunnel terpisah"

msgid "Sets AmneziaWG to split tunnel: configured interface started if down, only traffic to subnets listed in /etc/split-routes/*.lst files routed via AmneziaWG."
msgstr "Mengatur AmneziaWG ke tunnel terpisah: antarmuka yang dikonfigurasi dijalankan jika mati, hanya lalu lintas ke subnet yang tercantum dalam file /etc/split-routes/*.lst yang dirutekan melalui AmneziaWG."

msgid "Stop AmneziaWG"
msgstr "Hentikan AmneziaWG"

msgid "Start Passwall2"
msgstr "Jalankan Passwall2"

msgid "Stop Passwall2"
msgstr "Hentikan Passwall2"

msgid "Show SMS"
msgstr "Tampilkan SMS"

msgid "Show SMS on GL-E750 display. Additional settings in \"Inbox\""
msgstr "Tampilkan SMS di layar GL-E750. Pengaturan tambahan di \"Kotak masuk\""

msgid "Toggle Standby mode"
msgstr "Alihkan mode siaga"

msgid "Toggle Metrics"
msgstr "Alihkan metrik"

msgid "Output system metrics on GL-E750 display: bandwidth via WAN interface, number of connections, load, CPU usage, memory available. Second screen: RSRP, RSRQ, SINR, RSSI of the signal. Change screen by switch flip. Exits automatically after 10 min."
msgstr "Menampilkan metrik sistem di layar GL-E750: lebar pita melalui antarmuka WAN, jumlah koneksi, beban, penggunaan CPU, memori tersedia. Layar kedua: RSRP, RSRQ, SINR, RSSI sinyal. Ganti layar dengan menggeser sakelar. Keluar otomatis setelah 10 menit."

msgid "Enable action"
msgstr "Aktifkan aksi"

msgid "Long press"
msgstr "Tekan lama"

msgid "Hold right button for 3 s."
msgstr "Tahan tombol kanan selama 3 detik."

msgid "Double flip"
msgstr "Geser ganda"

msgid "Flip switch and back to original position within 2 s."
msgstr "Geser sakelar lalu kembalikan ke posisi semula dalam 2 detik."

msgid "Next page"
msgstr "Halaman berikutnya"

msgid "Next message"
msgstr "Pesan berikutnya"

msgid "Previous message"
msgstr "Pesan sebelumnya"

msgid "Replay message"
msgstr "Tampilkan ulang pesan"

msgid "Mark all read and exit"
msgstr "Tandai semua sudah dibaca dan keluar"

msgid "Exit"
msgstr "Keluar"

msgid "Switch flip"
msgstr "Geser sakelar"

msgid "Show SMS mode"
msgstr "Mode tampilan SMS"

msgid "This mode also activates if configured in 'Inbox'. Button actions below apply only to this mode."
msgstr "Mode ini juga aktif jika dikonfigurasi di \"Kotak masuk\". Aksi tombol di bawah hanya berlaku untuk mode ini."

msgid "Show the new-message notification icon on the status overview page and GL-E750 display"
msgstr "Tampilkan ikon notifikasi pesan baru di halaman ringkasan status dan layar GL-E750"
